{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/07/11/5474317/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まひろがさゆりんつまんでみた"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりかがまあやつまんでみた"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"わっっっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさん...優しいねえ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/07/11/5474317/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大喜利ありがとうございました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"電車の中で読んでてぶって吹いた。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"周辺の人たちに変な目で"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"見られちゃったじゃんよ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"責任とってよ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"...なんてね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/07/11/5474317/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すきだなって思ったの紹介します。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"知らない方は前回の記事の3枚目の"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"写真と照らし合わせてみてください。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「た、食べてないよ！そ、そこにあったお菓子なんて知らないよ！！」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「ここがななみんの故郷か〜」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「き、君しか見えない（物理的な意味で）」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「ねね、大きくなり過ぎww」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どれもおもしろかったです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとうございました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たまにはこういうのもいいね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/07/11/5474317/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ね！ブログって楽しいね！ね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"奇跡的な一枚か撮れたらまた載せるお"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"**********"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/07/11/5474317/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"食事で気にしていることはある？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/07/11/5474317/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お菓子食べないように頑張ってる。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"代わりにナッツ食べてるのよ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"気にしないでばくばく"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"食べたいんだけどねーうーん。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/07/11/5474317/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ユニフォーム後ろってM・ITO？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/07/11/5474317/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"うん"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/07/11/5474317/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"部屋に飾っちゃった！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/07/11/5474317/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お祭りで売ってるたべもので"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりっかの好きなものはなに？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/07/11/5474317/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たこ焼き、焼きそば"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"りんご飴とかかわいすぎて食べられん。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/07/11/5474317/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"海派それともプール派？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/07/11/5474317/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"海！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/07/11/5474317/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"好きな色の組み合わせ教えてー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/07/11/5474317/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"緑と紫、青とピンク"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/07/11/5474317/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"行きたいところとかある？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/07/11/5474317/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"屋久島"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/07/11/5474317/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/07/11/5474317/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"自信を失ったとき"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どうやって自信を取り戻しますか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/07/11/5474317/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"自信になったことばを思い出す。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"人からもらったことばでもなんでも。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"プリンシパルで何度も思い出して、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"気持ちの切り替えをしてました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/07/11/5474317/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どんなデコメが好きなの？？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/07/11/5474317/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"好きなのしか集めてないよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/07/11/5474317/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぜんぶかわいいのー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/07/11/5474317/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ファンの人の顔覚えられる派？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/07/11/5474317/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"覚えるように頑張ってます。！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/07/11/5474317/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"夏には毎年浴衣を着てる？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/07/11/5474317/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"浴衣持ってないんよ。欲しい"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/07/11/5474317/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"友達と、乃木メン\nどっちのほうが遊ぶのおおいですか－？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/07/11/5474317/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おんなじくらい！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/07/11/5474317/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"甚平と浴衣どっちが好きですか 〜？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/07/11/5474317/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だいぶ前に生写真で甚平着たなー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"甚平の方がお腹苦しくないから"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"楽そうだけど浴衣も着たいの"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/07/11/5474317/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"**********"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"録画してたバンジージャンプの回の"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木どこ見ました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"泣いてしまいました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当にお疲れ様！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんなのためにありがとう！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"キャプテン！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/07/11/5474317/0009.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"鎖骨。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりか"}],"source":"archive"}